  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• To a medium bowl, add haloumi and cover with water to soak.\n• Zest lemon to get a pinch and slice into wedges.\n• Finely chop garlic.\n• Pick thyme leaves.\n• Grate carrot. Thinly slice red radish and cucumber into rounds.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8b4676038927854113a9-ae1190fe.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a medium saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.\n• Cook carrot until softened, 2 minutes. Add garlic and cook until fragrant, 1 minute.\n• Add the water and a good pinch of salt and pepper and bring to the boil. Add wholemeal couscous and stir to combine.\n• Cover with a lid and remove from heat. Set aside until all the water is absorbed, 5 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8b4676038927854113a9-351a4b35.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.\n• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat. Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side.\n• Remove from heat, add the honey, thyme leaves, and a splash of water turning haloumi to coat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8b4676038927854113a9-5ddf9d6a.jpeg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• To the couscous, add radish, cucumber, spinach & rocket mix, lemon zest, a good squeeze of lemon juice and a drizzle of olive oil. Season to taste.\n• Divide wholemeal couscous salad between bowls, then top with haloumi.\n• Drizzle over creamy pesto dressing.\n• Serve with any remaining lemon wedges. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/recipe/step-675f8b4676038927854113a9-1326ffb3.jpeg"
    }
  ]
}
